## Recovery Prompt (For Cursor)
If the `sync_locales.dart` script is ever lost, corrupted, or needs to be rebuilt from scratch, pass this prompt to Cursor:

> **CONTEXT:** `lib/l10n/langs/`
> **PROBLEM:** We need a Dart CLI script to synchronize localization keys. `en.dart` is the Single Source of Truth.
> **TASK:** Create `scripts/sync_locales.dart`. 
> 1. Parse `en.dart` to extract all keys.
> 2. Scan all other `.dart` files in `lib/l10n/langs/`.
> 3. If a key is missing in a target file, inject it at the bottom.
> 4. Set the injected value to: `"[TODO] " + englishValue`.
> 5. Do not destroy existing formatting. Use pure Dart (Regex/String manipulation).